{
  "name": "Aasani Doodle Factory v2",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🎨 Aasani Doodle Factory v2\n\n**Simplified Architecture:**\n1. Input topic/pain point\n2. GPT-4o generates script + scene descriptions\n3. DALL-E 3 generates doodle images\n4. ElevenLabs generates voiceover\n5. Creatomate assembles final video\n6. Save to Google Drive\n\n**Credentials Needed:**\n- OpenRouter API (for GPT-4o + DALL-E 3)\n- ElevenLabs API\n- Creatomate API\n- Google Drive OAuth",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-480, -100],
      "id": "sticky-intro",
      "name": "Intro"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Aasani Doodle Factory",
        "formDescription": "Transform your business pain point into an engaging doodle-style Instagram Reel",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Topic / Pain Point",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "e.g., Sales team missing leads due to inconsistent data entry across multiple systems",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Target Audience",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "placeholder": "e.g., Small business owners, Sales managers",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Video Duration",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {"option": "30 seconds (4-5 scenes)"},
                  {"option": "60 seconds (6-8 scenes)"}
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Call to Action",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "placeholder": "e.g., Visit aasani.ai to learn more",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "respondWithData": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-100, 200],
      "id": "form-trigger",
      "name": "Input Form",
      "webhookId": "aasani-doodle-factory-v2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "topic",
              "name": "topic",
              "value": "={{ $json['Topic / Pain Point'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "audience",
              "name": "target_audience",
              "value": "={{ $json['Target Audience'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "duration",
              "name": "duration",
              "value": "={{ $json['Video Duration'].includes('30') ? 30 : 60 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "scene_count",
              "name": "scene_count",
              "value": "={{ $json['Video Duration'].includes('30') ? 5 : 7 }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "cta",
              "name": "cta",
              "value": "={{ $json['Call to Action'] }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [140, 200],
      "id": "set-inputs",
      "name": "Set Inputs"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Generate Script\nGPT-4o creates scene-by-scene breakdown",
        "height": 80,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [340, 100],
      "id": "sticky-step1",
      "name": "Step 1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"openai/gpt-4o\",\n  \"response_format\": { \"type\": \"json_object\" },\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are an expert scriptwriter for whiteboard doodle explainer videos. You create scripts for Aasani AI, a business automation company. Your videos explain business pain points and position Aasani as the solution.\\n\\nYour scripts must:\\n- Hook viewers in the first 2 seconds with a relatable pain point\\n- Use simple visual metaphors perfect for doodle illustrations\\n- Keep each scene to 4-6 seconds of narration\\n- End with a clear call-to-action\\n\\nRETURN ONLY VALID JSON in this exact format:\\n{\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"Short video title\\\",\\n  \\\"hook\\\": \\\"Opening hook line (2 sec)\\\",\\n  \\\"scenes\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"scene_number\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"duration_seconds\\\": 5,\\n      \\\"voiceover_text\\\": \\\"What the narrator says\\\",\\n      \\\"visual_description\\\": \\\"Detailed description of what to draw - stick figures, icons, arrows, simple shapes\\\",\\n      \\\"text_overlay\\\": \\\"Optional short text on screen\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"instagram_caption\\\": \\\"Engaging caption with line breaks and emojis\\\",\\n  \\\"hashtags\\\": [\\\"hashtag1\\\", \\\"hashtag2\\\"]\\n}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Create a {{ $json.duration }}-second doodle video script with exactly {{ $json.scene_count }} scenes.\\n\\n**Topic/Pain Point:** {{ $json.topic }}\\n\\n**Target Audience:** {{ $json.target_audience }}\\n\\n**Call to Action:** {{ $json.cta }}\\n\\n**Visual Style Guidelines:**\\n- Black marker doodles on white background\\n- Simple stick figures for people\\n- Basic icons and shapes (arrows, gears, checkmarks, X marks)\\n- Thought bubbles, speech bubbles\\n- Simple graphs or charts when relevant\\n- Hand-drawn style text labels\\n- The Aasani logo appears in the final scene\\n\\nMake it relatable, slightly humorous, and educational.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [380, 200],
      "id": "openrouter-script",
      "name": "Generate Script (GPT-4o)",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "OPENROUTER_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenRouter API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse the script from OpenRouter response\nconst response = $input.first().json;\nconst content = response.choices[0].message.content;\n\ntry {\n  const script = JSON.parse(content);\n  \n  // Add metadata\n  script.generated_at = new Date().toISOString();\n  script.total_duration = script.scenes.reduce((sum, s) => sum + s.duration_seconds, 0);\n  \n  return { json: script };\n} catch (error) {\n  throw new Error('Failed to parse script JSON: ' + error.message);\n}"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [620, 200],
      "id": "parse-script",
      "name": "Parse Script"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Generate Doodle Images\nDALL-E 3 creates images for each scene",
        "height": 80,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [820, 100],
      "id": "sticky-step2",
      "name": "Step 2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "scenes",
        "options": {
          "destinationFieldName": "scene",
          "include": "selectedOtherFields",
          "fieldsToInclude": "title, hook, instagram_caption, hashtags, total_duration"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [860, 200],
      "id": "split-scenes",
      "name": "Split Scenes"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1100, 200],
      "id": "loop-scenes",
      "name": "Loop Scenes"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"openai/dall-e-3\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Create a whiteboard doodle illustration for a business explainer video.\\n\\n**Scene Description:** {{ $json.scene.visual_description }}\\n\\n**Text Overlay (if any):** {{ $json.scene.text_overlay || 'None' }}\\n\\n**STRICT STYLE REQUIREMENTS:**\\n- Pure white background (like a whiteboard)\\n- Black marker/pen line art only\\n- Hand-drawn doodle aesthetic\\n- Simple stick figures for any people\\n- Basic icons: arrows, checkmarks, X marks, gears, lightbulbs\\n- Minimalist, clean composition\\n- NO photorealistic elements\\n- NO gradients or shading\\n- NO colors except black lines on white\\n- Style similar to RSA Animate whiteboard videos\\n- Vertical format optimized for Instagram Reels (9:16 aspect ratio)\\n\\nThe image should look like someone quickly sketched it on a whiteboard with a black marker.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"max_tokens\": 1000\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1340, 300],
      "id": "generate-image",
      "name": "Generate Doodle (DALL-E 3)",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "OPENROUTER_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenRouter API"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/images/generations",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"dall-e-3\",\n  \"prompt\": \"Create a whiteboard doodle illustration for a business explainer video. Scene: {{ $json.scene.visual_description }}. {{ $json.scene.text_overlay ? 'Include text label: ' + $json.scene.text_overlay : '' }} STYLE: Pure white background, black marker line art only, hand-drawn doodle aesthetic, simple stick figures, minimalist icons (arrows, checkmarks, gears), NO photorealistic elements, NO colors except black on white, RSA Animate whiteboard style, vertical 9:16 format for Instagram Reels.\",\n  \"n\": 1,\n  \"size\": \"1024x1792\",\n  \"quality\": \"standard\"\n}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1340, 200],
      "id": "generate-image-direct",
